  "title": "GPT Image gains editing",
  "summary": "May expanded what people could build with Pollinations, especially with images and text, while making access and the growing app directory easier to navigate.\n\nAdded `gptimage` for image generation, then added editing, quality controls, and multiple reference images. Image prompt translation also got a reliability fix.\n\nText requests gained more room, new model options, JSON Schema forwarding, and sampling controls. WebSim added prompt-to-HTML generation with model selection.\n\nMCP gained a local CLI and OAuth flow. Shared authentication and queue handling, dashboard tiers, tier-based routing, and a preferences API made account behavior more defined.\n\nCommunity additions ranged from chat and coding tools to image apps, accessibility software, and video projects. Categories and featured-project ordering were cleaned up so the directory could keep pace.",
